@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
title UC7: Confirm or Reject Incoming Order - Activity Diagram
start
:Hub Kitchen receives new incoming order alert;
:System starts 2-minute SLA countdown timer;
:Kitchen staff inspects multi-brand order items and station loads;
if (Kitchen accepts order?) then (Confirm)
  :Click 'Confirm Order';
  :System updates order state to 'Confirmed';
  :Split order items across physical kitchen stations;
  :Generate and print station kitchen tickets;
  :Notify Customer and assign delivery dispatch pool;
else (Reject)
  :Click 'Reject Order';
  :Select mandatory rejection reason (Out of stock / Station overload);
  :System updates order state to 'Rejected';
  :Trigger automated e-wallet refund;
  :Send cancellation notice and apology voucher to customer;
endif
stop
@enduml
